    "summary": "While this model leads a unit, after you pick the targets of the led unit's attacks in [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), if all those attacks target one unit, roll a D6 for that target and a D6 for each other enemy unit up to 3\" from it. On a 5+, explosive debris strikes the unit rolled for. After the led unit has finished its attacks on the target, every unit that explosive debris struck takes D3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds).",
